<Doc title="Orange Pi 4 Pro header" subtitle="the forty pins, as the board reports them" category="Boards" id="opi4proPinout">

<!--
  A PINOUT, and nothing else: the diagram. GENERATED by tools/opi4pro_pinout.py
  from `gpio readall` on the board; edit the script, not this file.

  What this car has on which pin belongs on the page that includes this one:

      <Include file="pinouts/orangepi-4-pro.bdoc"/>
-->

<Draw width="1280" height="1000">
# Orange Pi 4 Pro, 40-pin header. Left column odd pins, right column even,
# pin 1 at the top - the same way round as the board with its USB-C toward you.

